flowchart TD
  ING["Offline ingest: pipeline chunks<br/>embedded with Gemini"] --> QD[(Qdrant knowledge base)]
  U[User question] --> PRE["Pre-search Qdrant<br/>results injected for this request only"]
  QD --> PRE
  PRE --> L{{Agent loop}}
  L <-->|further searches| DT["documents tool<br/>Qdrant HTTP client"] <--> QD
  L --> A["Answer<br/>pre-injected results never stored in history"]
